# Cloudflare Workers static-asset redirects.
#
# zudo-doc@4.5.0's versions page hardcodes the entry-doc slug as a flat
# `docs/getting-started` (dist/versions-page/index.js:40,46 — no prop, no
# setting), but this project's entry doc is nested at
# `docs/overview/getting-started`. Every "Docs" link on /docs/versions/ —
# Latest and every snapshot row — therefore 404s.
#
# Redirecting at the asset layer fixes all rows at once without touching
# snapshot content: adding a stub `getting-started` page inside docs-v2.0/ or
# docs-v1.0/ would put a page in an archive that never shipped in that release.
#
# Remove these once upstream zudolab/zudo-doc#3195 ships a configurable
# entry slug and this project adopts it.
#
# Placeholder rules count against Cloudflare's 100-dynamic-rule limit; these
# four are well under it.

/docs/getting-started              /docs/overview/getting-started/              301
/docs/getting-started/             /docs/overview/getting-started/              301
/ja/docs/getting-started           /ja/docs/overview/getting-started/           301
/ja/docs/getting-started/          /ja/docs/overview/getting-started/           301
/v/:version/docs/getting-started   /v/:version/docs/overview/getting-started/   301
/v/:version/docs/getting-started/  /v/:version/docs/overview/getting-started/   301
/v/:version/ja/docs/getting-started  /v/:version/ja/docs/overview/getting-started/  301
/v/:version/ja/docs/getting-started/ /v/:version/ja/docs/overview/getting-started/  301

# The Claude section (/docs/claude, /docs/claude-md/*, /docs/claude-skills/*)
# is generated from the repo's live .claude/ directory by the claude-resources
# plugin, which only ever writes into the DEFAULT docsDir. It is inherently
# unversioned — there is exactly one copy — so snapshots deliberately do not
# carry it (see the versions block in zfb.config.ts).
#
# Two things still emit versioned Claude URLs, and both 404 without these rules:
#   - the header nav's "Claude" item, version-prefixed on every snapshot page
#     (88 links across /v/1.0/ and /v/2.0/) — the visible one: clicking Claude
#     from any archived page was a dead end;
#   - the version switcher on Claude pages, offering snapshot links for pages
#     that exist only in Latest (upstream zudolab/zudo-doc#3196).
#
# Sending both to the canonical unversioned page is the correct destination:
# the content is the same regardless of which doc version you came from.

/v/:version/docs/claude              /docs/claude                     301
/v/:version/docs/claude/             /docs/claude                     301
/v/:version/ja/docs/claude           /ja/docs/claude                  301
/v/:version/ja/docs/claude/          /ja/docs/claude                  301
/v/:version/docs/claude-md/*         /docs/claude-md/:splat           301
/v/:version/docs/claude-skills/*     /docs/claude-skills/:splat       301
/v/:version/docs/claude-agents/*     /docs/claude-agents/:splat       301
/v/:version/docs/claude-commands/*   /docs/claude-commands/:splat     301
